# track-keys (M8): P's track from the keyboard (FV 07 › P scrubber; ExtentSlider.tsx). Ten plain Tabs
# reach it as Chromium tabs (call 3 f; WebKit's sixth): its thumb's ring and the value tip over it.
# → steps 0.1, Shift+→ 1 (3.10), Home and End jump to the range's lattice ends (−9.36, 9.36: P off
# the view, the ▲ before its role); Enter opens P's field with its text selected and the typing tip
# under P's head; "-1.5" typed and Enter applies it, the track taking the focus back with its ring
# (call 3 g); Enter again and Esc put the value back, the ring on the track again. The shots as P
# leaves the view catch its edge marker a frame into its arrival (160 ms, 8 px in on the enter
# spring; M10 made the port's).
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 2000
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
tab
wait 16
shot focused
key ArrowRight
key ArrowRight shift
wait 500
shot stepped
key Home
wait 16
shot home
wait 484
key End
wait 16
shot end
wait 484
key Enter
wait 16
shot field-open
type "-1.5"
wait 16
shot typed
key Enter
wait 500
shot applied
key Enter
wait 16
key Escape
wait 500
shot escaped
